From fe75be987dd97a1ede6582007590704846cd130b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anzhe Li <lianzhe1@h-partners.com>
Date: Mon, 29 Jun 2026 15:12:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ub:ubutils: Optimized the log printing and spelling of
 English words

driver inclusion
category: bugfix
bugzilla: https://atomgit.com/openeuler/ubutils/issues/5
CVE: NA

-----------------------------------------------------------

The ubutils code contains some issues related to code compilation
standards and English spelling errors. Therefore, we have
optimized the code by adding log printing, corrected the
spelling errors, and fixed the code's blank lines.

Signed-off-by: Anzhe Li <lianzhe1@h-partners.com>
---
